  "left_as_upstream": [
    "telemetry attribute names (pi.ai.*, pi.harness.*, pi.operation.*, pi.session.*): internal schema, not shown to the user",
    "protocol identifiers sent to third parties: openai-codex originator, xai referrer, x-opencode-client",
    "code identifiers (getPiUserAgent, checkForNewPiVersion, extension API parameter named pi, the pi key of package manifests, session entry type pi.share)",
    "import specifiers of the Pi libraries (@earendil-works/pi-ai, pi-tui, pi-agent-core ...)",
    "docs/ and CHANGELOG.md: upstream Pi documentation, with docs/PINK.md mapping the names",
    "https://pi.dev/session/ (the /share viewer) and https://pi.dev/changelog (links the user opens on purpose)",
    "the Pi CHANGELOG.md stays in the package but Pink never shows it at startup (Pi release notes are not Pink's)"
  ]
